  "totalBlocks": 95,
  "translatedBlocks": 85,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d914923a140ce60",
      "translationZh": "LoRA 适配器为各种规模和类型的模型提供了极大的定制空间。在图像生成方面，它们可以赋予模型不同的风格、不同的角色，以及更多能力。有时，它们还可以用于降低推理延迟。因此，它们的重要性不言而喻，尤其是在模型定制和微调方面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a08f8c2c7a3e9af",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，考虑到 Flux.1-Dev 模型在文生图领域的广泛普及和应用，我们选择以它为例，介绍如何优化其使用 LoRA 时的推理速度（约提升 2.3 倍）。据 Hugging Face Hub 平台统计，基于该模型训练的适配器已超过 30k 个。因此，它对社区具有重要意义。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dee3bbb412a42169",
      "translationZh": "请注意，尽管我们使用 Flux 展示加速效果，但我们认为，这套方案具有足够的通用性，也可以应用于其他模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cedcc9764417ca04",
      "translationZh": "如果你已经迫不及待地想上手代码，请查看配套的代码仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e331da0741fb6d05",
      "translationZh": "目录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c243da66238cae03",
      "translationZh": "优化 LoRA 推理的障碍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aefe5bd6378cb784",
      "translationZh": "优化方案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8cad877262e3c133",
      "translationZh": "在消费级 GPU 上优化 LoRA 推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c243da66238cae03",
      "translationZh": "优化 LoRA 推理的障碍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b756477cd9db74e",
      "translationZh": "在提供 LoRA 推理服务时，通常需要对其进行热切换（换入和换出不同的 LoRA）。LoRA 会改变基础模型的架构。此外，各个 LoRA 之间也可能存在差异——它们的秩可能不同，进行适配的目标层也可能不同。考虑到 LoRA 的这些动态特性，我们必须采取必要措施，确保所应用的优化具有稳健性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e032af4625feb54b",
      "translationZh": "例如，我们可以对加载了特定 LoRA 的模型应用 torch.compile，以降低推理延迟。然而，一旦将该 LoRA 替换为另一个 LoRA（其配置可能不同），就会遇到重新编译问题，导致推理速度下降。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3deb32014e08f08e",
      "translationZh": "也可以先将 LoRA 参数融合到基础模型参数中，再执行编译，并在加载新的 LoRA 参数时撤销原有 LoRA 参数的融合。然而，由于可能发生架构层面的变化，这种方法仍会在每次运行推理时遇到重新编译的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46ae40014824f60f",
      "translationZh": "我们的优化方案考虑了上述情况，以尽可能贴近实际。以下是我们优化方案的关键组成部分：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ca1749976f0956d9",
      "translationZh": "使用 TorchAO 进行 FP8 量化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "545717e0c8d39c54",
      "translationZh": "支持热切换",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26d2ed5aaf1e3e2c",
      "translationZh": "请注意，在上述方法中，FP8 量化是有损的，但往往能在速度与内存占用之间实现极为出色的权衡。尽管我们主要使用 NVIDIA GPU 测试这套方案，但它应该也适用于 AMD GPU。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "aefe5bd6378cb784",
      "translationZh": "优化方案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7cbc1b42f55751ef",
      "translationZh": "在之前的博客文章（文章 1 和文章 2）中，我们已经讨论过使用这套优化方案中前三个组件的好处。逐一应用它们只需几行代码：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65482897fbbbdbe1",
      "translationZh": "FA3 处理器来自这里。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "371187529a2e74e3",
      "translationZh": "当我们尝试在不触发重新编译的情况下，将 LoRA 换入已编译的扩散 Transformer（pipe.transformer）或从中换出时，问题就开始显现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fcb7c395f532728",
      "translationZh": "通常，加载和卸载 LoRA 都需要重新编译，这会抵消编译带来的任何速度优势。好在有一种方法可以避免重新编译。通过传入 hotswap=True，diffusers 会保持模型架构不变，仅替换 LoRA 适配器本身的权重，而这并不需要重新编译。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04c9b48911942793",
      "translationZh": "（提醒一下，由于 torch.compile 是即时编译器，首次调用 pipe 会比较慢。不过，后续调用应该会明显更快。）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2a85e7581155346",
      "translationZh": "这通常允许在不重新编译的情况下切换 LoRA，但存在一些限制：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "323839a11eabc899",
      "translationZh": "我们需要提前提供所有 LoRA 适配器中的最大秩。因此，如果一个适配器的秩为 16，另一个为 32，就需要传入 max_rank=32。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b7cefd4dc1f2c34a",
      "translationZh": "通过热切换换入的 LoRA 适配器只能作用于第一个 LoRA 所针对的相同层，或这些层的子集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2fdc2566b2d3ba60",
      "translationZh": "目前尚不支持以文本编码器为目标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbdbb25b58478787",
      "translationZh": "有关 Diffusers 中热切换及其限制的更多信息，请参阅文档中的热切换章节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b42c43945a7e73e4",
      "translationZh": "当我们查看未将编译与热切换结合使用时的推理延迟，就能明显看出这一工作流程的优势。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45aaacba7ea1a668",
      "translationZh": "选项",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f72b7eb19868038e",
      "translationZh": "时间（s）⬇️",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54f4394a0bc35fc1",
      "translationZh": "加速比（相对于基线）⬆️",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a7525b1492fb848",
      "translationZh": "备注",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ba8496a2525ae17",
      "translationZh": "基线",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc9ea7f7c64e772c",
      "translationZh": "基线",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e309757b16e4781d",
      "translationZh": "已优化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0cc167bf9a1380d",
      "translationZh": "热替换 + 编译，无重新编译导致的卡顿（默认启用 FP8）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c09b5a6ff2133590",
      "translationZh": "与优化配置相同，但禁用 FP8 量化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5dc7a5d8c07e22aa",
      "translationZh": "禁用 FA3（flash‑attention v3）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c217df70a75589a",
      "translationZh": "基线 + 编译",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a600ec2fb32a2496",
      "translationZh": "开启编译，但存在间歇性的重新编译停顿",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6db52dd97989fd56",
      "translationZh": "禁用 FA3 和 FP8",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0119b3a49b086f84",
      "translationZh": "禁用 FP8 量化和编译",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "045cfb17812677f4",
      "translationZh": "禁用编译：速度最慢的设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb023e65132f6abc",
      "translationZh": "关键要点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6413a70e72f17f3c",
      "translationZh": "“regular + compile”选项相较于常规选项有不错的加速效果，但会引发重新编译问题，从而增加整体执行时间。在我们的基准测试中，未计入编译时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c1552217a9eb9d1f",
      "translationZh": "通过热切换消除重新编译问题后（即“optimized”选项），我们实现了最高的加速比。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6a0d25667a160986",
      "translationZh": "“optimized”选项启用了 FP8 量化，这可能导致质量损失。即使不使用 FP8，我们也能获得相当可观的加速效果（“no_fp8”选项）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2c72ac8d81ad46bf",
      "translationZh": "出于演示目的，我们使用一个包含两个 LoRA 的池，在启用编译的情况下进行热切换。完整代码请参阅配套代码仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91e42b2b6a639bac",
      "translationZh": "到目前为止，我们讨论的优化方案都假定可以使用 H100 这样的高性能 GPU。然而，当我们只能使用 RTX 4090 这样的消费级 GPU 时，又能做些什么呢？让我们一探究竟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8cad877262e3c133",
      "translationZh": "在消费级 GPU 上优化 LoRA 推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "490f6ad5e5c30163",
      "translationZh": "使用 Bfloat16 数据类型的 Flux.1-Dev（不加载任何 LoRA）运行时需要约 33GB 内存。根据 LoRA 模块的大小，如果不进行任何优化，内存占用还可能进一步增加。RTX 4090 等许多消费级 GPU 只有 24GB 显存。在本节余下的内容中，我们将使用一台配备 RTX 4090 的机器作为测试平台。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "842f416940c561b2",
      "translationZh": "首先，为了让 Flux.1-Dev 能够端到端运行，我们可以采用 CPU 卸载，将执行当前计算时不需要的组件卸载到 CPU，从而释放更多加速器内存。这样，我们就能在 RTX 4090 上以约 22GB 的显存占用运行整个流水线，耗时 35.403 秒。启用编译后，延迟可降至 31.205 秒（加速 1.12 倍）。在代码层面，只需要几行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b70fa075cec95bd9",
      "translationZh": "请注意，我们在这里没有应用 FP8 量化，因为它不支持与 CPU 卸载和编译配合使用（相关问题讨论帖）。因此，仅对 Flux Transformer 应用 FP8 量化也不足以缓解内存耗尽问题。在这个场景中，我们决定移除它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "000de6958154cfe3",
      "translationZh": "因此，要利用 FP8 量化方案，我们需要找到一种不使用 CPU 卸载的方法。对于 Flux.1-Dev，如果我们再对 T5 文本编码器进行量化，应该就能在 24GB 显存中加载并运行完整的流水线。下面对比了对 T5 文本编码器进行量化和不进行量化时的结果（使用 bitsandbytes 的 NF4 量化）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "999b2eef95813159",
      "translationZh": "从上图可以看出，对 T5 文本编码器进行量化并不会造成太大的质量损失。将量化后的 T5 文本编码器、经过 FP8 量化的 Flux Transformer 与 torch.compile 结合使用，得到了还算不错的结果——耗时从 32.27 秒降至 9.668 秒（大幅加速约 3.3 倍），而且没有明显的质量下降。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9b480059224e3ef",
      "translationZh": "即使不对 T5 文本编码器进行量化，也可以在 24 GB 显存中生成图像，但那样会让我们的生成流水线稍微复杂一些。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1f861230bff9b4e",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们已经有办法在 RTX 4090 上使用 FP8 量化运行整个 Flux.1-Dev 流水线。我们可以应用此前确立的优化方案，在同一硬件上优化 LoRA 推理。由于 RTX 4090 不支持 FA3，我们将沿用以下优化方案，并新加入 T5 量化：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d5079cbb47b49472",
      "translationZh": "FP8 量化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "545717e0c8d39c54",
